{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB推出結合「煮食」及「選秀」元素於一身的綜藝真人騷《星廚》，尋找既有偶像特質、亦有高超廚藝的「烹飪界型男索女」。</p><p>《星廚》今天（3日）展開全球招募，截止報名日期為11月17日（周二）晚上11時59分（香港時間）。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:08.165759+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T10:05:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:14.600771+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:22.708358+00:00","content_hash":"ae3f9adbb2f7d5c663a70900927042d0593e0b45eb643238e523a0a882a8b957","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}